{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "intro",
      "content": {
        "json": "# IIC Hybrid Orders — 360 service operations\nOne customer outcome, three execution planes: **Azure** (Front Door, coordinator, Service Bus), **on-premises** (validation worker on the SCVMM/SDN cluster) and **AWS** (fulfillment worker, EKS portal). The Health Model decides health; this workbook explains it. Faults (`deep-thought`, `marvin`, `vogon`) apply to demo-tagged orders only."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "t1",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 3600000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 900000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 259200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "e1",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Environment",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "Production",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "jsonData": "[\"Production\",\"Development\"]"
          },
          {
            "id": "c1",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "CorrelationId",
            "label": "Correlation ID (optional)",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "name": "tabs",
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "tab0",
            "cellValue": "Tab",
